# General information

The dataset provides resting-state EEG data (eyes open, eyes closed) from
80 participants whose autistic traits were assessed using the Autism-Spectrum
Quotient-10 (AQ-10). Participants were divided into a High-AQ group (n = 41,
AQ-10 ≥ 6) and a Low-AQ group (n = 39, AQ-10 ≤ 2). The dataset also provides
individual AQ-10 scores and demographic information.

# Dataset

## Presentation

The data collection was conducted at Chongqing Normal University, China. The
detailed description of the dataset is currently under preparation by Junyu Wu,
Rong Huang, Jingyang Yu, Jiayi Shi, Tianze Wang, Yuting Zhang, Yutong Chen
and Jing Meng, and will be submitted for publication.

## EEG acquisition

* EEG system: ANT Neuro eego 64 amplifier with a 64-channel waveguard cap
* Sampling frequency: 500 Hz
* Impedances were kept below 5 k


